1. Defines jwt_b64_encode(data) to base64url encode JSON bytes
2. Creates HS256 signed JWTs with given payloads
3. Runs subprocess calls for each test
4. Captures and prints all outputs

Run the script and return the full output of all test results. Also save the full script to /tmp/behavior_test.py.

